ready: 1
kind: system
id: sys.model
name: Model provider
role: Answers Kernle's appraisal, extraction, and emotion requests with the model the owner chose
system_kind: external
notes: >-
  One of: the Anthropic API, an OpenAI-compatible endpoint (including local
  Ollama or LM Studio), a runtime command-line tool in headless mode, or the
  host agent through MCP sampling. It receives only the excerpts a request
  needs.
secrets:
  - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
  - OPENAI_API_KEY
